  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760386,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the charming world of horse care and equestrian adventure with *2 in 1: My Riding Stables + My Riding Stables: Life with Horses* for the Nintendo DS! This delightful compilation combines two beloved games, offering a double dose of stable-hand fun.\n\nBegin your journey as a new stable hand, responsible for nurturing adorable foals and ensuring the comfort of your guests.  Care for your horses, groom them to perfection, and provide expert riding lessons to aspiring equestrians.  Prepare your horses and students for the spotlight, guiding them to become the riding stars of tomorrow. \n\n*My Riding Stables: Life with Horses* expands on the experience, allowing you to deepen your connection with your horses and build a thriving stable.  Manage your resources, expand your facilities, and unlock new breeds and activities.  With engaging gameplay, charming characters, and a heartwarming story, this Nintendo DS title is perfect for animal lovers and aspiring horse trainers of all ages.  Experience the joy of horsemanship in this unique and captivating package!"
    },
